OL,3,AFarmer left in abandoned, freezing town
OL,4,Awithout food and water for TV show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 33-year-old was dropped into the
OL,7,Ftown with nothing but the clothes he
OL,8,Fwas wearing - with temperatures
OL,9,Fdropping as low as -12C (10F) during
OL,10,Fthe challenge.
